e new legislation.\n*  The article on Venetia Stanley's father was corrected to accurately reflect his religious conversion.\n\nP.P.S. This paraphrase provides a concise summary of the corrections published by The Guardian, highlighting the types of errors addressed and the newspaper's commitment to accuracy.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Section", "logprob": -1.8358061424805783e-05}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.055015675723552704}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.35043570399284363}, {"token": "▁Guardian", "logprob": -0.0795823410153389}, {"token": "▁has", "logprob": -0.6963135004043579}, {"token": "▁issued", "logprob": -0.36664071679115295}, {"token": "▁several", "logprob": -0.032942984253168106}, {"token": "▁corrections", "logprob": -0.003609453560784459}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.14138755202293396}, {"token": "▁its", "logprob": -0.033842623233795166}, {"token": "▁published", "logprob": -0.4076582193374634}, {"token": "▁articles", "logprob": -0.0019493164727464318}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.23601441085338593}, {"token": "▁These", "logprob": -0.019575266167521477}, {"token": "▁corrections", "logprob": -0.17157164216041565}, {"token": "▁address", "logprob": -0.055161893367767334}, {"token": "▁inaccuracies", "logprob": -0.3332890272140503}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.24633800983428955}, {"token": "▁reporting", "logprob": -0.05856919288635254}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -0.5476301312446594}, {"token": "▁clarify", "logprob": -0.5172954797744751}, {"token": "▁details", "logprob": -0.05451685190200806}, {"token": "▁regarding", "logprob": -1.6208401918411255}, {"token": "▁individuals", "logprob": -0.027102362364530563}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -1.0552390813827515}, {"token": "▁events", "logprob": -0.0008535317610949278}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.12221678346395493}, {"token": "▁The", "logprob": -0.06166213005781174}, {"token": "▁corrections", "logprob": -0.8240381479263306}, {"to